# two-people-leaving

Alice and carol both ask to be forgotten, at the same time. Carol wrote under alice's meme, 
so erasing alice's content starts a cascade that takes a row carol's own closure has 
reserved — two sagas on two partitions, no order between them, and one of them destroying 
what the other promised to hold. 

